              "NUM.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.14.1+JOS.14.2+JOS.14.3+JOS.14.4+JOS.14.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Josh 14.1-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Moses commanded the people of Israel, saying, “This is the land which you shall inherit by lot, which the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has commanded to give to the nine tribes and to the half-tribe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for the tribe of the sons of Reuben by fathers' houses and the tribe of the sons of Gad by their fathers' houses have received their inheritance, and also the half-tribe of Manasseh; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the two tribes and the half-tribe have received their inheritance beyond the Jordan at Jericho eastward, toward the sunrise.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“These are the names of the men who shall divide the land to you for inheritance: Eleazar the priest and Joshua the son of Nun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You shall take one leader of every tribe, to divide the land for inheritance. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are the names of the men: Of the tribe of Judah, Caleb the son of Jephunneh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Of the tribe of the sons of Simeon, Shemuel the son of Ammihud. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Of the tribe of Benjamin, Elidad the son of Chislon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Of the tribe of the sons of Dan a leader, Bukki the son of Jogli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Of the sons of Joseph: of the tribe of the sons of Manasseh a leader, Hanniel the son of Ephod. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And of the tribe of the sons of Ephraim a leader, Kemuel the son of Shiphtan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Of the tribe of the sons of Zebulun a leader, Eli-zaphan the son of Parnach. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Of the tribe of the sons of Issachar a leader, Paltiel the son of Azzan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And of the tribe of the sons of Asher a leader, Ahihud the son of Shelomi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Of the tribe of the sons of Naphtali a leader, Pedahel the son of Ammihud. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are the men whom the ",
          "type": "text",
